    "In TrollStore's Settings, turn on URL Scheme. TrollStore ignores enable-jit requests without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 TrollStore 的“设置”中打开 URL Scheme。否则 TrollStore 会忽略启用 JIT 的请求。"
