            "value": "游戏上次启动的日志末尾。反馈问题时请附上它。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Ende des Protokolls vom letzten Start des Spiels. Teile es, wenn du ein Problem meldest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first check downloads and mounts Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次检查会下载并挂载 Apple 的开发者磁盘镜像，可能需要一分钟。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die erste Prüfung lädt Apples Developer Disk Image herunter und mountet es, was eine Minute dauern kann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game and everything it saved here are deleted from BetterHusk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏及其在 BetterHusk 中保存的全部内容都会被删除。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Spiel und alles, was es hier gespeichert hat, werden aus BetterHusk gelöscht."
