            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fenster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it Android boots from cold, which takes several minutes. The download is %@, and it replaces what is inside Android now, including installed apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有它，Android 将冷启动，需要几分钟。下载大小为 %@，会替换 Android 当前的内容，包括已安装的应用。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne ihn bootet Android kalt, was mehrere Minuten dauert. Der Download ist %@ groß und ersetzt, was aktuell in Android ist, einschließlich installierter Apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可用"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Läuft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can skip this: BetterHusk asks again when a game needs it, and it is in Settings › JIT & Sideload.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
